Buttons joined into one seamless control.
[Appica docs](https://appica.dev/ui/components/react/button-group)

<%= embed UI::ButtonGroupPreview, :default %>

## Usage

```ruby
ButtonGroup(variant: :outline, aria_label: "Range") do
  Button { "Years" }
  Button { "Months" }
  Button { "Days" }
end
```

The group squares the inner corners and overlaps the shared borders of its [Buttons](<%= page_path(:button) %>), and
gives them its `variant:`, `size:`, `icon:` and `disabled:` - set them once on the group. A button's own variant or
size wins; the group's `disabled:` can't be undone by a button.

