## API reference

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| `variant:` | Button variants | - | For every button (they default to `:primary`). |
| `size:` | `:sm`, `:md`, `:lg` | - | For every button. |
| `icon:` | `Boolean` | - | Square icon-only buttons. |
| `orientation:` | `:horizontal`, `:vertical` | `:horizontal` | A row or a column. |
| `disabled:` | `Boolean` | `false` | Disables every button. |

## Accessibility

- A `role="group"`: add `aria_label:` when its purpose isn't clear from context.
- Each button stays a normal button in the tab order; label icon-only ones.
